ts blisteringly fast, responsive, and secure web solutions. Leveraging modern technologies like Next.js, React, and robust API architectures, we turn visitors into paying customers with seamless user experiences.","benefits":["Sub-second page loading speeds and 95+ Google Lighthouse scores","Fully responsive UI engineered for mobile, tablet, and desktop","Built-in enterprise SEO foundations and semantic accessibility","Secure, maintainable codebase ready for future scaling"],"deliverables":["Custom responsive web application or website","Content management dashboard or headless CMS integration","Speed optimization, SSL setup, and domain configuration","Contact & lead capture forms with database storage","30-day post-launch technical support and training"],"suitableFor":["Startups needing a high-impact launch website","Established companies revamping outdated sites","E-commerce brands seeking custom online storefronts","Consultancies, clinics, and professional firms"],"pricingRange":{"min":35000,"max":150000,"currency":"INR","unit":"per project"},"iconName":"Code","isActive":true,"order":2},{"id":"srv-3","slug":"creative-design","title":"Brand Identity & Creative Design","team":"Creative Design Team","shortDescription":"Memorable brand identity, modern logo systems, high-converting social media creatives, marketing graphics, and premium digital collateral.","fullDescription":"The Creative Design Team translates business vision into visual authority. From foundational brand guidelines and typography systems to daily marketing graphics and event banners, we create designs that captivate and convert.","benefits":["Cohesive visual identity that commands premium pricing","Eye-catching social graphics that elevate brand credibility","Vector asset libraries for print, digital, and outdoor media","Distinctive market positioning that stands out from competitors"],"deliverables":["Complete brand identity guide (color palette, typography, usage)","Vector logo package (primary, secondary, submarks, favicon)","Social media template kit (Figma/Photoshop/Canva)","Marketing collateral (brochures, business cards, pitch decks)","High-resolution promotional banner designs"],"suitableFor":["New businesses needing complete brand creation","Rebranding established organizations","Retailers & consumer goods brands","Event organizers and digital product companies"],"pricingRange":{"min":15000,"max":60000,"currency":"INR","unit":"per project"},"iconName":"Palette","isActive":true,"order":3},{"id":"srv-4","slug":"video-production","title":"Video Production & Short-Form Editing","team":"Video Production & Editing Team","shortDescription":"Viral Instagram Reels, YouTube Shorts, brand documentary videos, promotional advertisements, and high-retention video content.","fullDescription":"Video is the highest-leverage medium for modern brands. Our Video Production & Editing Team crafts dynamic, high-retention short-form and promotional video content that stops thumbs, sparks conversations, and drives action.","benefits":["High retention rates driven by pacing, sound design, and motion graphics","Optimized for Instagram Reels, YouTube Shorts, and TikTok algorithms","Professional color grading and cinematic visual polish","Fast turnaround workflows for rapid trend capitalization"],"deliverables":["Paced short-form video edits with dynamic subtitles and sound FX","Brand promo videos and high-converting product ads","Motion graphics, title intros, and logo animations","Audio leveling, noise reduction, and licensing clearing","Multi-format exports (9:16 vertical, 16:9 widescreen, 1:1 square)"],"suitableFor":["Content creators and influencers","E-commerce brands advertising on Meta & TikTok","Hospitality, real estate, and lifestyle businesses","Corporate entities requiring internal or promotional video"],"pricingRange":{"min":18000,"max":70000,"currency":"INR","unit":"per batch / project"},"iconName":"Film","isActive":true,"order":4},{"id":"srv-5","slug":"seo-growth","title":"SEO & Organic Growth Optimization","team":"SEO & Growth Team","shortDescription":"Technical SEO audits, keyword strategy, high-intent content planning, and organic search engine ranking that attracts qualified buyers consistently.","fullDescription":"Our SEO & Growth Team positions your brand at the exact moment potential customers are searching for your solutions. We execute deep technical audits, comprehensive keyword clustering, and link-worthy content strategies for long-term organic dominance.","benefits":["Sustainable inbound traffic without continuous ad spend","Higher conversion rates from high-intent search queries","Technical health improvements that protect site integrity","Local SEO dominance in Google Maps and local search results"],"deliverables":["Exhaustive technical SEO and core web vitals audit","High-intent competitor and keyword gap analysis","On-page content optimization and meta architecture","Google Search Console and Google Analytics configuration","Monthly organic search ranking and traffic progress reports"],"suitableFor":["Local businesses targeting geographic customer bases","B2B service providers seeking inbound corporate leads","High-volume e-commerce stores","Professional medical, legal, and financial practices"],"pricingRange":{"min":25000,"max":80000,"currency":"INR","unit":"per month"},"iconName":"Search","isActive":true,"order":5}],"isStandalonePage":true}],["$","$L3",null,{}]]}],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L4",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","services","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L5",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/ee21f917229e1686.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}]],["$","html",null,{"lang":"en","className":"dark scroll-smooth